ed as the Marquis of Fuchun, and the clan resided in Fuchun for generations. The imperial clan of Eastern Wu. Sun Jian and Sun Ce laid the foundation in Jiangdong, and Sun Quan would Proclaim Emperor to establish the state, standing in a tripartite balance with Wei and Shu for nearly sixty years before ultimately being destroyed by Sima Jin, enduring as the longest-lasting regime among the Three Kingdoms."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"4","politics":"7"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[[["WJ11004","小女子"],["WJ11004","小女子"],["WJ11004","This humble maiden"],["WJ11004","私め"],["WJ11004","소녀"]]],"specialNames":[[["WJ11004","WJ10140","叔父"],["WJ11004","WJ10140","叔父"],["WJ11004","WJ10140","Uncle"],["WJ11004","WJ10140","叔父上"],["WJ11004","WJ10140","숙부"]]],"vip":{"isVIP":1,"from":"185","to":"200"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"35","startPregnantAge":"35"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[71,55,75,81,89,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,55,75,81,89,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":"WJ10038","city":"CS1047","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,55,75,81,89,70],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014802","helmet":"WP1013102"},"couple":[]},{